{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">THIS-OBJECT statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310817","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/THIS-OBJECT-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/THIS-OBJECT-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">THIS-OBJECT statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement__section_N1002D_N1002A_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">A statement that invokes an overloaded constructor\nas the first statement in another overloaded constructor within\nthe same defining class.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement__syntax_GC1B1B62704993\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d447218e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement__idGDP30A2677363\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>THIS-OBJECT ( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong>\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var>\n            <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var>\n            <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong>\n            <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">...</strong>\n            <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">Specifies zero or more parameters passed to the specified\noverloaded constructor. You must match the parameters identified\nby the called constructor with respect to number, data type, and\nmode, and you must specify sufficient information for each <var class=\"keyword varname\">parameter</var> to\ndisambiguate the specified constructor from all other constructors\nin the class. Otherwise, ABL raises an error identifying the ambiguity.</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">For\ninformation on the parameter passing syntax and disambiguating overloaded\nconstructors, see the <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Parameter-passing-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Parameter-passing-syntax.html\">Parameter passing syntax</a> reference entry.</p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement__notes_GC1B1B72705005\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d447218e196\">Note</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">If you\ninvoke an overloaded constructor in the defining class using THIS-OBJECT,\nif the constructor that you invoke does not, itself, invoke another\noverloaded constructor in the defining class, it must invoke a constructor\nin the immediate super class, either implicitly or explicitly using\nthe SUPER statement.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"THIS-OBJECT-statement__see-also_GC1B1B92705009\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d447218e205\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CONSTRUCTOR-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CONSTRUCTOR-statement.html\">CONSTRUCTOR statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Parameter-passing-syntax.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Parameter-passing-syntax.html\">Parameter passing syntax</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SUPER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUPER-statement.html\">SUPER statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"THIS-OBJECT-system-reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/THIS-OBJECT-system-reference.html\">THIS-OBJECT system reference</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TERMINAL-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TERMINAL-statement.html\">TERMINAL statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"THIS-OBJECT-system-reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/THIS-OBJECT-system-reference.html\">THIS-OBJECT system reference</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310817","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"THIS-OBJECT statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/THIS-OBJECT-statement.html","type":"Manual"}